{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Every male.</b> This passage was stated in the pericope of ויקרא and repeated here for three things: the commandment 'shall eat it,' 'in a holy place,' 'every male shall eat it.'" "<b>All who.</b> Whoever comes to touch them — <b>shall be sanctified</b> and purify himself before touching."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:10:14.622467404Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}